{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, replacing avgpool aggregation from experiment 003. Validation accuracy improved slightly to 0.653 (from 0.6501) with a nearly identical F1 score of 0.628. The marginal accuracy gain suggests transformer aggregation may offer marginal benefits, but the lack of direct comparison to other aggregation methods or encoder variations leaves uncertainty about its specific contribution to performance."
}

